{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并金剛界眾形色。東都聖善寺沙門􈎭􄕍􄑀吉祥集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "坐白蓮花上，種種光圍繞，在熾光明中坐。身金色，手持真多摩尼寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如大王形，坐白蓮花上，手持俱\n緣菓□睹輪王勢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十佛頂名號"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從東北角起首畫向南也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "種種嚴具莊著輕□衣。\n其身形不麁不細中庸形，右手持青蓮花，左手施願，坐花台上，作淺綠色也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身白色，三目四臂，右上手持仗，左上手持瓶，右下手持念\n珠，左下手持蓮花，身儀寂靜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以蓮花鬘莊嚴身，用寶繒角絡被，右\n手持真多摩尼寶，左手施願，坐蓮花上。此是一切蓮花族母"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "坐寶蓮花\n上，合掌作禮勢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "結定即身□如金"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如天形，坐蓮花上，合掌作禮勢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身相如瑜伽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如名別無相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "右手持白拂，左手持金剛杵，坐蓮花上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名摩莫枳，身相如童女，淡紫青色，種種瓔珞莊嚴。坐蓮花上，住般若自性，右手持梵夾，左手持真多摩尼。\n施願勢，不得高顏□悅意。是金剛族母"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作童子形"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "准被髮相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "手執白拂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "形如天女，坐寶蓮花，種種莊嚴。身如金色，目觀\n眾會。著輕穀衣角被，右手持寶，左手施願。圓光周遍，身相寂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "形如\n天母，色相同前。唯右手持蓮花，左手施願。光明同前無異"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身相金色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十二聖者名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "形服皆金色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四臂，右第一手持羂索，左手持鉞斧，\n右第二手施願，左第二手持菓。坐於蓮花，光明同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "形服皆金色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此上二龍王曾見佛，有七\n頭，合掌跪地。即上嚩哩迦阿難陀也，唯持花鬘有異也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即尼蓮河神也，並\n見佛來。身相如目止隣龍王，更無別狀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身白色，以二手捧寶花籠子，二膝跪地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "持蓮\n花鬘，曲躬合掌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并前二龍王，青色黑色。如女形，七頭，合掌作禮勢，前後同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "相端嚴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "形服皆金色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是明妃，形如天女，種種瓔珞莊嚴。其身青色，手執蓮\n\n花，坐寶山上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "形服皆金色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "坐蓮花臺，如女形，首戴寶冠，左手執\n五古杵，右手施願。身相端嚴，圓光熾盛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身如作禮勢，合掌坐蓮臺，金色具端\n嚴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前大惠相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前寂靜相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前無垢惠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十聖名號"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二手捧燈臺，身形衣服並赤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "形服並綠色，搖鈴居本門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "衣服身形黃色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "形服青，執鉤在本位"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "黑色，二手執香爐"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "形服並黃，執索當門位"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "坐白\n蓮花，衣服面色具白。二手持花，供養勢也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "形服並赤，持鎖本位中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十天名號"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘如灌頂儀中廣說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先北金、東白銀、南吠瑠璃色青色、西頗胝迦寶色紅色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘如經說也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云闕寶量不空毘盧，居頂後，餘\n從額配之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛寶地，大悲地界所執持故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "功德乳海所資𨳝故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三昧惠炬所溫育故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "除障智風所開發故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無邊性空不障礙故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合。此云細，細如金剛。此陀羅尼能令所觀\n\n成就"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丁以反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合。此云不動如金剛。此陀羅尼\n能令所觀無失"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合。此云周遍如金剛。此陀羅尼能令所\n觀漸廣量周法界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合。此云了達如金剛。此陀羅尼能令所觀漸\n略猶如毫端，住白毫際或住鼻端，隨心所樂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "書本云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "朱筆"}
{"id": null, "n": "0327012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0327012", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】東寺三密藏古寫本"}
